@startuml
title Doctor CLI - Casos de Uso
left to right direction

actor "Pessoa usuaria" as User
actor "Pessoa mantenedora/suporte" as Support
actor "Sistema operacional" as OS
actor "Emacs" as Emacs
actor "Infraestrutura de voz/TTS" as TTS

rectangle "emacs-a11y doctor" {
  usecase "Executar diagnostico textual" as UC_TEXT
  usecase "Executar diagnostico JSON" as UC_JSON
  usecase "Verificar ambiente" as UC_ENV
  usecase "Verificar Emacs" as UC_EMACS
  usecase "Verificar perfil" as UC_PROFILE
  usecase "Verificar configuracao pessoal" as UC_USERCFG
  usecase "Verificar TTS" as UC_TTS
  usecase "Verificar Emacspeak" as UC_EPEAK
  usecase "Interpretar proximos passos" as UC_NEXT
}

User --> UC_TEXT
Support --> UC_JSON
UC_TEXT .> UC_ENV : <<include>>
UC_TEXT .> UC_EMACS : <<include>>
UC_TEXT .> UC_PROFILE : <<include>>
UC_TEXT .> UC_USERCFG : <<include>>
UC_TEXT .> UC_TTS : <<include>>
UC_TEXT .> UC_EPEAK : <<include>>
UC_TEXT .> UC_NEXT : <<include>>

UC_JSON .> UC_ENV : <<include>>
UC_JSON .> UC_EMACS : <<include>>
UC_JSON .> UC_PROFILE : <<include>>
UC_JSON .> UC_USERCFG : <<include>>
UC_JSON .> UC_TTS : <<include>>
UC_JSON .> UC_EPEAK : <<include>>

OS --> UC_ENV
Emacs --> UC_EMACS
TTS --> UC_TTS

note right of UC_TEXT
Somente leitura:
nao modifica sistema
end note
@enduml
